<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">RepoMod-Bench: A Benchmark for Code Repository Modernization via Implementation-Agnostic Testing</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
