</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Per-Benchmark Results</h4>

<div id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S3.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Per-Benchmark Results ‣ 3.2. Results ‣ 3. Experiments ‣ RepoMod-Bench: A Benchmark for Code Repository Modernization via Implementation-Agnostic Testing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows detailed results for each benchmark sorted by source code size.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4. </span>Per-benchmark pass rates (%). Complexity is measured by LOC. LOC = Lines of Code. <span id="S3.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CC</span> = Claude Code. <span id="S3.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Codex</span> = Codex CLI. OC-C=OpenCode (Claude). OC-O=OpenCode (OpenAI). <span id="S3.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> indicates a pass rate <math id="S3.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math> 10%.</figcaption>
<table id="S3.T4.8" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S3.T4.8.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T4.8.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Complexity</span></th>
<th id="S3.T4.8.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.8.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Benchmark</span></th>
<td id="S3.T4.8.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.8.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CC</span></td>
<td id="S3.T4.8.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.8.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Codex</span></td>
<td id="S3.T4.8.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.8.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">OC-C</span></td>
<td id="S3.T4.8.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.8.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">OC-O</span></td></tr>
